================================================================================
Third-party attribution
================================================================================

Each solver here is a Kotlin port of an existing solver, and every original is
MIT licensed. The port keeps the original copyright and adds the port on the
same line; the full original license texts are in licenses/.

  MicroSAT — Copyright (c) 2014-2017 Marijn Heule; Kotlin port by Manfred Scheucher 2026
             (licenses/microsat-LICENSE.txt)
  MiniSat  — Copyright (c) 2003-2010 Niklas Eén, Niklas Sörensson; Kotlin port by Manfred Scheucher 2026
             (licenses/minisat-LICENSE.txt)
  CaDiCaL  — Copyright (c) 2016-2026 Armin Biere and contributors; Kotlin port by Manfred Scheucher 2026
             (licenses/cadical-LICENSE.txt)
  kissat   — Copyright (c) 2019-2025 Armin Biere and contributors; Kotlin port by Manfred Scheucher 2026
             (licenses/kissat-LICENSE.txt)

The cadical and kissat ports cover the CDCL search core only, not the
inprocessing machinery. The original solver sources are included under shadow/
as references for the byte-for-byte shadow tests.
